rem Multiples of 3 or 5
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=1
rem Sum multiples of 3 or 5 below 1000

use ranges
use numbers
use io
use cli

rem Upper boundary, excluded.
option Limit integer = 1000

N = 1 until Limit

Mask = N multiple by 3
Mask or= N multiple by 5

Answer = N Mask sum
Answer print
